{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>西藏林芝市白羽村的白普隆溝景區迎來最美秋景，雪山為遊客提供熱門徒步路線。原始天然林色彩斑斕，天空湛藍、雲海翻湧。過去兩年，新興旅遊服務為白羽村帶來近400萬元人民幣收入，累計接待遊客逾3萬人次。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"8503088_西藏林芝秋色 雪山步道迎客.mp4 - 截图4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/20ff6dc970cc482bbfc42c3ce4c51920/snapshots/9e2d42ecb0564430a4c37134a066ac63-00004.jpg\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>林芝市文化和旅遊局最新統計顯示，自2021年6月拉林鐵路開通以來，林芝鄉村旅遊接待遊客超過1,500萬人次，帶動15.7萬農牧民參與，總收入達6.14億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T00:41:14.600893+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:19.353757+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T00:38:44.172194+00:00","content_hash":"3e7e79d003b2c4c6d52556d6a7ebbcf8082690071bc6c7658cf78993f145f5ec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-25T00:41:14.600893+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}